    <header class="top">
      <div class="crumb"><span class="jd">60.16</span><span>Field Programs Meta &amp; FRED</span><span class="sep">/</span><b>Impact model — Church-Centric BT</b></div>
      <div class="search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16.5 16.5 4 4"/></svg><span>Search everything</span><span class="k">⌘K</span></div>
      <div class="tacts">
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13h7M9 17h4"/></svg>Export PDF</button>
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4v6h6M20 20v-6h-6"/><path d="M20 9A8 8 0 0 0 5.6 5.6M4 15a8 8 0 0 0 14.4 3.4"/></svg>Run snapshot</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="phead">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">One model per portfolio · nightly snapshots</p>
          <h1>Impact model</h1>
          <p class="lede">The narrative theory of change is a page; each metric is a whitelisted, versioned query over platform data. Impact sits beside budget-versus-actual and the grants that funded it — which is what makes a grant report assemble itself.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:20px">
          <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Metrics</span><span class="v">8</span><span class="d">1 failing</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Last run</span><span class="v" style="font-size:17px">2026-08-25</span><span class="d">03:14 UTC · 7 of 8 ok</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;min-width:0">
          <div class="chd">
            <h2>Metric definitions</h2>
            <div class="r"><span class="sub">a metric nobody can check is a claim without evidence</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cbd flush">
            <table class="tbl">
              <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Definition</th><th>Unit</th><th class="num">Target</th><th class="num">Latest</th><th style="width:104px">Trend</th><th>Run</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <sc-for list="{{metrics}}" as="m" hint-placeholder-count="8">
                  <tr class="{{m.cls}} hov" onClick="{{m.pick}}">
                    <td><div style="font-weight:700">{{m.name}}</div><div class="mono" style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:10.5px">{{m.key}}</div></td>
                    <td style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px">{{m.def}}</td>
                    <td>{{m.unit}}</td>
                    <td class="num">{{m.target}}</td>
                    <td class="num" style="font-weight:800">{{m.latest}}</td>
                    <td>
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 96 26" style="width:96px;height:26px">
                        <polyline points="{{m.spark}}" fill="none" stroke="{{m.color}}" stroke-width="2"></polyline>
                      </svg>
                    </td>
                    <td><span class="b {{m.tone}}">{{m.status}}</span></td>
                  </tr>
                </sc-for>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="prov"><span>Each metric is a versioned query, not a number somebody typed</span><span>·</span><span class="mono">impact_metrics · impact_snapshots</span><span>·</span><a>CSV</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="width:340px;flex:0 0 340px">
          <div class="chd"><h2>{{selName}}</h2><div class="r"><span class="b {{selTone}}">{{selStatus}}</span></div></div>
          <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:5px">Definition</h3>
              <p style="margin:0;color:#3A4A53;font-size:12.5px">{{selDef}}</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:16px">
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Latest</span><span class="v" style="font-size:19px">{{selLatest}}</span><span class="d">{{selAsOf}}</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Target</span><span class="v" style="font-size:19px">{{selTarget}}</span><span class="d">{{selDir}}</span></div>
            </div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 300 96" style="width:100%;height:auto">
              <line x1="10" y1="86" x2="292" y2="86" stroke="#C4D3DB" stroke-width="1.2"></line>
              <polyline points="{{selSeries}}" fill="none" stroke="#31ADE3" stroke-width="2.4"></polyline>
              <line x1="10" y1="{{targetY}}" x2="292" y2="{{targetY}}" stroke="#C97F14" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></line>
            </svg>
            <div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">Dashed line is target. Series is one point per nightly run; a failed run is a gap, never an interpolation.</div>
            <sc-if value="{{selFailed}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
              <div class="gate">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 9v5M12 17h.01"/><path d="M10.3 4.3 2.6 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 4.3a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/></svg>
                <div>{{selError}}</div>
              </div>
            </sc-if>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:6px">Feeds</h3>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
                <span class="b i">portfolio dashboard</span><span class="b i">grant report — 2025-3311</span>
                <span class="b c">board packet Q3</span><span class="b n">public impact page</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row" style="margin-top:14px">
        <div class="card" style="flex:1">
          <div class="chd"><h2>Theory of change</h2><div class="r"><span class="b n">the model itself is a page</span></div></div>
          <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:stretch">
            <sc-for list="{{toc}}" as="t" hint-placeholder-count="5">
              <div style="flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:11px 12px;background:#FCFDFE">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:5px">
                  <span style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:{{t.color}};color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:10px">{{t.n}}</span>
                  <span style="font-weight:800;font-size:12px">{{t.name}}</span>
                </div>
                <div style="color:#3A4A53;font-size:11.5px">{{t.text}}</div>
                <div style="margin-top:7px"><span class="b {{t.tone}}">{{t.metric}}</span></div>
              </div>
            </sc-for>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
